  <result type="1">
   <title>
    <narrative xml:lang="EN">Output 1.2: Technical equipment to support new infrastructure, operations at sea and identify false documents are provided.</narrative>
   </title>
   <reference code="273184" vocabulary="99"></reference>
   <indicator aggregation-status="0" ascending="1" measure="1">
    <title>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN"># of new infrastructure supported through specific equipment</narrative>
    </title>
    <period>
     <period-start iso-date="2022-01-01"></period-start>
     <period-end iso-date="2022-12-31"></period-end>
     <target value="Support the provision of suitable equipment to strengthen the capacity of the Maritime National Guard and the Border Police in the field of Search and Rescue at Sea and Border Control."></target>
     <actual value="2 regional trainings sessions dedicated to senior police officers took place at the Police Academy and training center in Cairo, 17 to 26 October 2022 and 14 to 24 November 2022. Representatives from the Ministries of Interior of different countries in Northern, Central, East, and Western Africa met to discuss and exchange good practices on migration-related crimes such as trafficking in persons, smuggling of migrants and travel document fraud. Participants were trained by highly qualified experts from Interpol, Europol, the Egyptian MoI, and IOM."></actual>
    </period>
